{"id":"be91b23166ea0402","group":"28","path":"28/28-prop-independent-set-product.md","title":"Independent-Subset Graph Product","display":"prop-independent-set-product — Independent-Subset Graph Product","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-prop-independent-set-product","aliases":["28-prop-independent-set-product"],"display":"prop-independent-set-product — Independent-Subset Graph Product","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §11.4, proof of Theorem 11.15; corrected adjacency and vertex domain","source_printed_pages":"248","source_pdf_pages":"274","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-prop-independent-set-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-prop-independent-set-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-independent-set-product — Independent-Subset Graph Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §11.4, proof of Theorem 11.15; corrected adjacency and vertex domain"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"248"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"274"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,E)\">\\(G=(V,E)\\)</span> 为有限简单图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I(G)\">\\(\\mathcal I(G)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha(G)\">\\(\\alpha(G)\\)</span> 由下式内建。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\binom ak=0\">\\(\\binom ak=0\\)</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a&lt;k\">\\(a&lt;k\\)</span>；空图的独立数为0。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I(G)\\coloneqq\\{I\\subseteq V:\\forall u\\ne v\\in I\\ \\{u,v\\}\\notin E\\},\\qquad\\alpha(G)\\coloneqq\\max_{I\\in\\mathcal I(G)}|I|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I(G)\\coloneqq\\{I\\subseteq V:\\forall u\\ne v\\in I\\ \\{u,v\\}\\notin E\\},\\qquad\\alpha(G)\\coloneqq\\max_{I\\in\\mathcal I(G)}|I|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V^{[k]}\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathcal I(G):|S|=k\\},\\qquad E^{[k]}\\coloneqq\\{\\{S,T\\}:S,T\\in V^{[k]},\\ S\\ne T,\\ S\\cup T\\notin\\mathcal I(G)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V^{[k]}\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathcal I(G):|S|=k\\},\\qquad E^{[k]}\\coloneqq\\{\\{S,T\\}:S,T\\in V^{[k]},\\ S\\ne T,\\ S\\cup T\\notin\\mathcal I(G)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G^{[k]}\\coloneqq(V^{[k]},E^{[k]}),\\qquad \\alpha(G^{[k]})=\\binom{\\alpha(G)}k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G^{[k]}\\coloneqq(V^{[k]},E^{[k]}),\\qquad \\alpha(G^{[k]})=\\binom{\\alpha(G)}k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任一非空独立顶点族的并是G中独立集：同一S内无边，任意两S,T的并也无边。故族规模不超过binom(α(G),k)。最大独立集的全部k子集达到此界。α&lt;k时顶点集为空。原书的“相邻当且仅当并独立”方向与随后结论不符；这里取非独立为有边，并限制顶点为独立k子集以补足退化情形。</p>\n<p>来源：§11.4, proof of Theorem 11.15; corrected adjacency and vertex domain；印刷页 248；PDF 页 274。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第11章的 Independent-Subset Graph Product，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n<p>原书方向的最小反例：G是两个孤立顶点且k=1；若不同单点子集在其并独立时相邻，所得图为K₂，独立数1，而原文公式给binom(2,1)=2。本条修正方向后所得图仍为两个孤立顶点，独立数2；k=0已由Hypothesis排除。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,E)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\binom ak=0","display":false},{"tex":"a<k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I(G)\\coloneqq\\{I\\subseteq V:\\forall u\\ne v\\in I\\ \\{u,v\\}\\notin E\\},\\qquad\\alpha(G)\\coloneqq\\max_{I\\in\\mathcal I(G)}|I|.","display":true},{"tex":"V^{[k]}\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathcal I(G):|S|=k\\},\\qquad E^{[k]}\\coloneqq\\{\\{S,T\\}:S,T\\in V^{[k]},\\ S\\ne T,\\ S\\cup T\\notin\\mathcal I(G)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"G^{[k]}\\coloneqq(V^{[k]},E^{[k]}),\\qquad \\alpha(G^{[k]})=\\binom{\\alpha(G)}k.","display":true}],"bytes":2277,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-330","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-qcsp]]、[[28-lem-clause-assignment-graph]]、[[28-prop-independent-set-product]]、[[28-prop-vertex-cover-gap-transfer]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}